ders-halt-to-taxpayer-funded-promo-ads-of-trump/a-79636117--60cf0f7ad1f7.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/us-judge-orders-halt-to-taxpayer-funded-promo-ads-of-trump/a-79636117?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Last week, President Donald Trump said he considered the ads to be a "positive promotion for our great USA." However, the New York district judge ruled that the commercials were an illegal misuse of funds.</summary><category term="News" /></entry></feed>
